0bfe6ee2ae54.plain:
Models in this unit don't use the normal Rapid Fire rules when firing Rapid Fire bolt weapons. Instead, they make twice as many attacks if at least one of these is true:
- the firing model's target is within half the range of the weapon;
- the firing model is INFANTRY and its unit Remained Stationary during your last Movement phase;
- the firing model is a TERMINATOR or BIKER model.
For this ability, a Rapid Fire bolt weapon means any bolt weapon (as the army rules define it) that has the Rapid Fire type.
